Specialisations and implementation priorities

Offer targeted specialisations

Specialisation | Evidence in the sample | Suggested exercise

Enterprise data platforms | Databricks: 6 role-linked. Snowflake: 5 role-linked. | Integrate one warehouse or lakehouse with customer applications and access rules.

Business application integration | Salesforce/ServiceNow: 11 total, 5 role-linked. | Build and operate one enterprise application connector.

